            B.q("sa-m4-15", "sa-governance", "Twenty related policies, such as encryption, diagnostic and network rules, must be assigned together to many management groups, with shared parameters and one compliance score. What do you recommend?", listOf("Assign each policy separately everywhere", "Group them in a policy initiative and assign the initiative", "Put them in a resource group", "Use Azure Blueprints"), setOf(1), "An initiative, or policy set definition, groups policies so they are assigned, parameterised and reported as one unit. Changes to the initiative reach every assignment.",
