            B.q("sa-m4-19", "sa-relational", "Every query against the database must be recorded and searchable with other logs for two years. What do you recommend?", listOf("Azure SQL auditing sending to a Log Analytics workspace", "The activity log", "Query Store", "Dynamic data masking"), setOf(0), "Azure SQL auditing records database events, including queries, and can send them to Log Analytics, storage or Event Hubs. In a workspace they can be searched with other logs and kept as long as needed.",
