            B.q("sa-m4-24", "sa-nonrelational", "Blobs should move to the cool tier when nobody has read them for 60 days, however old they are. What do you configure? Select two.", listOf("Enable last access time tracking on the storage account", "A lifecycle management rule using days since last access", "A rule using days since creation", "Move blobs with a weekly script"), setOf(0, 1), "Lifecycle management rules can act on the last time a blob was read, but only once last access time tracking is turned on. Popular old files stay hot, and unread ones move to a cheaper tier.",
                scenario = "Northbank Recipes stores dish photos for its Android cooking app. Some old photos are still popular, while many new ones are never opened.",
