            B.q("sa-m4-29", "sa-data-integration", "Analysts in Microsoft Fabric need to query files already in an Azure Data Lake Storage account, without copying them into OneLake. What do you recommend?", listOf("A OneLake shortcut to the Data Lake Storage location", "A nightly copy pipeline", "Download the files and upload them to Fabric", "Mirroring"), setOf(0), "A OneLake shortcut points at data stored elsewhere, such as Data Lake Storage, so it appears in a Fabric lakehouse as if it were local. Nothing is copied, and the data stays current.",
