            B.q("sa-m4-30", "sa-data-integration", "A wall screen must show live counts of orders per minute from a stream, updating every few seconds, built without writing an app. What do you recommend?", listOf("Stream Analytics with a Power BI output, shown in a Power BI dashboard", "A nightly Data Factory pipeline into a report", "Azure Backup reports", "Blob Storage static website"), setOf(0), "Stream Analytics can aggregate a stream over time windows and send the results straight to a Power BI output. A Power BI dashboard tile then updates in near real time, with no custom app.",
                scenario = "Saltire Pizza's Android ordering app sends each order to Event Hubs. The managers want a live screen in the head office during big football matches.",
                whyWrong = mapOf(
